@startuml dispatch_activity

skinparam backgroundColor #D3D3D3
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI

|Caller|
|Dispatcher|
|Handler|
|ModelBuilder|

|Caller|
start
:Submit ModelCommand;

|Dispatcher|
:Look up handler\nin dispatch table;
:Delegate to Handler;

if (Define Cmd?) then (Yes)
    :Construct domain object;
    :Write to context;
    :Return CommandResult.ok;

else if (Derive Cmd?) then (Yes)
    :Read queues from context;
    :Call ErlangC per queue;
    :Merge into demand SlotMatrix;
    :Write demand to context;
    :Return CommandResult.ok;

else if (Solve Cmd?) then (Yes)
    :Invalidate solve_results\non context;
    :Extract roster, queues,\ndemand from context;
    |ModelBuilder|
    :Build CP-SAT model\n(vars, constraints, objective);
    :Solve;
    :Build supply + shortfall\nSlotMatrices from solution;
    :Return SolverOutput;
    |Handler|
    :Assemble SolveResult\n(SolverOutput + roster snapshot);
    :Write to context via\nadd_solve_result(result);
    :Return CommandResult.ok;

else (Read Cmd)
    :Read SolveResult\nfrom context by label;
    :Serialize to dict;
    :Return CommandResult.ok\nwith data payload;

    note right
      Rendering is not Handler's concern.
      AgentTools.show() reads context
      directly and invokes ChartRenderer.
    end note

endif

|Dispatcher|
:Return CommandResult to caller;

|Caller|
stop

@enduml